OL,3,GNEWSAMother remembers girls murdered 40
OL,4,Ayears ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of one of two nine-year-old
OL,7,Fgirls murdered in Brighton 40 years
OL,8,Fago, says the pain of losing the
OL,9,Fchildren has never gone away.
OL,11,FKaren Hadaway and her friend Nicola
OL,12,FFellows disappeared while playing
OL,13,Foutside their homes on the Moulsecoomb
OL,14,Festate on 9 October 1986.
OL,16,FTheir bodies were found in Wild Park
OL,17,Fthe following day.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
