OL,3,GNEWSAMother remembers girls murdered 40
OL,4,Ayears ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a memorial event marking the 40th
OL,7,Fanniversary of their murders, Karen's
OL,8,Fmother Michelle Hadaway-Johnson said:
OL,9,F"They were just two little children out
OL,10,Fplaying one day, and they never came
OL,11,Fhome."
